@{
    Layout = "_PublicLayout";
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy";
}

<article class="fx-privacy">
    <h1>Privacy</h1>
    <p class="fx-privacy__lede">How Flexify handles member and staff data for this gym.</p>

    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <p>We store the information needed to run memberships and the front desk:</p>
    <ul>
        <li>Name, email, and contact details you provide at sign-up</li>
        <li>Membership plans, payment records, and check-in history</li>
        <li>Staff accounts used to operate the backoffice</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>How we use it</h2>
    <p>Data is used to manage access, renewals, payments, and attendance. We do not sell personal information. Staff can only see what their role allows.</p>

    <h2>Who can see it</h2>
    <p>Members see their own profile, plan, and visits. Front-desk and admin staff use the same data to check people in and process payments.</p>

    <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
    <p>We keep membership and payment history while your account is active and as needed for gym records. Ask the front desk if you want a copy of your data or to close your account.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions about privacy or your data: talk to staff at the gym, or email the address on your membership confirmation.</p>

    <p class="fx-privacy__foot">Last updated Nov 26, 2026</p>
</article>
